title: "Aerobatics Principles"
abstract: >-
  A primer on the principles of aerobatic flight, written exclusively for use
  within flight simulation. Covers energy management, angle of attack, load
  factor and flight controls, a set of progressive exercises, and the basic
  catalogue figures.
